1234567890 \equiv 1234567890 \mod 99 \equiv 1234567890 - 12345678 \times 99 \equiv 12345678 - 12345678 \equiv 12345678 \mod 99 \equiv 12345678 \mod 99 \equiv 12345678 - 12345 \times 99 \equiv 36 \pmod{99}
\] Thus, the remainder when 1,234,567,890 is divided by 99 is 36. </think> <think 

